    "text": "Consider the following gaseous equilibria with equilibrium constants <math><msub><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> respectively.<br />\r<br />\r<math><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mtext><mo>)</mo><mo>⇌</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mtext><mo>)</mo></math><br />\r<br />\r<math><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇌</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mtext><mo>)</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mtext></math><br />\r<br />\rThe equilibrium constants are related as",
