  "solution": {
    "text": "For the reaction,<br /><br /><math><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mtext><mo>)</mo><mo>⇌</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mtext><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />Equilibrium constant, <math><msub><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> ...(i)<br /><br />For the reaction,<br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇌</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mtext><mo>)</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mtext></math><br /><br />Equilibrium constant, <math><msub><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>[</mo><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> ...(ii)<br /><br />On squaring both sides in Eq.(i), we get<br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>[</mo><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow></mfrac></math> ...(iii)<br /><br />Eq. (ii) <math><mo>×</mo></math> Eq (iii), we get<br /><br /><math><msubsup><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>×</mo><msub><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />or <math><msub><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />or <math><msubsup><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>",
